# Frontend

- Prefer `@shadcn/*` from `common/foundation/resources/client/shadcn`. Fall back to `@ui/*` only when the shadcn component does not exist.
- Import aliases: `@app/*`, `@common/*`, `@shadcn/*`, `@ui/*`. Check `tsconfig.json` before inventing paths.
- Every visible string: `<Trans message="Publish product" />`. Dynamic messages cannot be extracted.
- Icons: `lucide-react`. Styling: tokens + `cn()` from `@ui/utils/cn`. Use `gap-*`, not `space-x-*` / `space-y-*`. Use `size-*` when width equals height.
- Stack is Base UI (`@base-ui/react`), not Radix. Read `migrate-radix-to-base` if you see `@radix-ui/*`.
- Do not introduce a new UI kit, raw hex/`bg-blue-500`, or untranslated copy.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<button className="bg-blue-500">Save</button>

// ✅ GOOD
import {Button} from '@shadcn/ui/button';
import {Trans} from '@ui/i18n/trans';

<Button type="submit">
  <Trans message="Save" />
</Button>
```
